{"id":"1a7474d8b25c4444","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-hyp-hierarchy.md","title":"按有效序数记号索引的跳跃层级","display":"df-hyp-hierarchy — 按有效序数记号索引的跳跃层级","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-hyp-hierarchy","aliases":["20-df-hyp-hierarchy"],"display":"df-hyp-hierarchy — 按有效序数记号索引的跳跃层级","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"definition-source-pending","source_reference":"书外有效记号层级的规范化；完整来源待补","depends_on":["[[20-df-kleene-O]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-hyp-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-hyp-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hyp-hierarchy — 按有效序数记号索引的跳跃层级"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-source-pending"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"书外有效记号层级的规范化；完整来源待补"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e811ef811223aaaa\" href=\"?note=e811ef811223aaaa\" title=\"20-df-kleene-O\">20-df-kleene-O</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(a\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,n,x\\in\\omega\">\\(e,n,x\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_\\mathcal O\">\\(&lt;_\\mathcal O\\)</span> 采用原最小归纳系统和原程序编号；按上游给出的良基关系使用集合上的良基递归。候选层级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(F:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>；基点、后继与极限形状均取自同一记号系统。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e811ef811223aaaa\" href=\"?note=e811ef811223aaaa\" title=\"20-df-kleene-O\">20-df-kleene-O</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>保留原 definition-source-pending 状态。这里显式化原层级的递归规范，不据此宣称已补齐书外来源、记号完备性证明或证明助手证书。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyp\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{HRec}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nF\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{\\mathcal O}\\land F(1)=\\varnothing\n\\land(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O\\ [F(2^a)=F(a)&#39;])\\\\\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\{j\\in\\omega:3\\cdot5^j\\in\\mathcal O\\}\\\n\\left[F(3\\cdot5^e)=\n\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:n,x\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists b\\in\\mathcal O\\ [\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=b\\land x\\in F(b)]\\}\\right],\\\\\n\\exists!F\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{\\mathcal O}\\ \\operatorname{HRec}(F),\\\\\nH:=\\bigcup\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{\\mathcal O}:\\operatorname{HRec}(F)\\},\\qquad\nH_a:=H(a)\\quad(a\\in\\mathcal O),\\\\\nH_1=\\varnothing,\\qquad H_{2^a}=H_a&#39;\\quad(a\\in\\mathcal O),\\\\\nH_{3\\cdot5^e}=\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:n,x\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists b\\in\\mathcal O\\ [\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=b\\land x\\in H_b]\\}\n\\quad(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyp\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{HRec}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nF\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{\\mathcal O}\\land F(1)=\\varnothing\n\\land(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O\\ [F(2^a)=F(a)&#39;])\\\\\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\{j\\in\\omega:3\\cdot5^j\\in\\mathcal O\\}\\\n\\left[F(3\\cdot5^e)=\n\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:n,x\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists b\\in\\mathcal O\\ [\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=b\\land x\\in F(b)]\\}\\right],\\\\\n\\exists!F\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{\\mathcal O}\\ \\operatorname{HRec}(F),\\\\\nH:=\\bigcup\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{\\mathcal O}:\\operatorname{HRec}(F)\\},\\qquad\nH_a:=H(a)\\quad(a\\in\\mathcal O),\\\\\nH_1=\\varnothing,\\qquad H_{2^a}=H_a&#39;\\quad(a\\in\\mathcal O),\\\\\nH_{3\\cdot5^e}=\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:n,x\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists b\\in\\mathcal O\\ [\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=b\\land x\\in H_b]\\}\n\\quad(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原 H 层级由基点、后继跳跃及基本序列列并唯一确定。现在先写出候选函数的完整递归谓词，再选取其唯一图；在极限式中先从程序停止图取得合法前驱 b，避免未经绑定地访问 H_{φ_e(n)}。</p>\n<p>原记号、极限列的配对方向、后继跳跃和各 H_a 的对象不变，也没有把同秩记号作商。唯一性是在所依赖的良基递归前提下的定义良定义性要求，不替代原保留的来源核验事项。</p>\n<p>来源：书外有效记号层级的规范化；完整来源待补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-kleene-O","status":"resolved","id":"e811ef811223aaaa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-kleene-O]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-kleene-O","status":"resolved","id":"e811ef811223aaaa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kleene-O]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kleene-O]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kleene-O]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"e,n,x\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"<_\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyp\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{HRec}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nF\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{\\mathcal O}\\land F(1)=\\varnothing\n\\land(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O\\ [F(2^a)=F(a)'])\\\\\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\{j\\in\\omega:3\\cdot5^j\\in\\mathcal O\\}\\\n\\left[F(3\\cdot5^e)=\n\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:n,x\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists b\\in\\mathcal O\\ [\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=b\\land x\\in F(b)]\\}\\right],\\\\\n\\exists!F\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{\\mathcal O}\\ \\operatorname{HRec}(F),\\\\\nH:=\\bigcup\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^{\\mathcal O}:\\operatorname{HRec}(F)\\},\\qquad\nH_a:=H(a)\\quad(a\\in\\mathcal O),\\\\\nH_1=\\varnothing,\\qquad H_{2^a}=H_a'\\quad(a\\in\\mathcal O),\\\\\nH_{3\\cdot5^e}=\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:n,x\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists b\\in\\mathcal O\\ [\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=b\\land x\\in H_b]\\}\n\\quad(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2619,"backlinks":[{"id":"d387a906642794f7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"4011ec29b6dff303","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"重点入口：编码与模型 [[20-df-strings]]、[[20-df-tmcomp]]、[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；对象与接口 [[20-df-tred]]、[[20-df-characteristic]]、[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；逻辑 [[20-df-formula]]、[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]、[[20-df-pa]]；树与构造 [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]、[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；博弈 [[20-df-gale-stewart]]、[[20-df-bm-strategy]]；良基递归 [[20-df-kleene-O]]、[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]。"}],"outgoing":["e811ef811223aaaa","e890b3c29e4a70a3","08b4fd5163a7f955"]}